      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Green%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hartong House and Farm, listed on the National Register of Historic Places, stands as Green’s first officially recognized historic property.",
